00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.349
But he is buried here. right?

257
00:13:02.416 --> 00:13:04.584
That's it! I'm losing it!

258
00:13:04.652 --> 00:13:06.720
I'm losing it!
You come all the way

259
00:13:06.787 --> 00:13:08.688
to Jerusalem.
the happiest place on earth.

260
00:13:08.756 --> 00:13:11.925
and all the photos in your
camera are of funny soda pops?!

261
00:13:12.894 --> 00:13:14.027
Oh. will you...

262
00:13:14.095 --> 00:13:15.262
You are such a...

263
00:13:16.664 --> 00:13:19.065
Chickpea fizz!

264
00:13:19.133 --> 00:13:21.268
Delete. Delete. Delete.

265
00:13:21.335 --> 00:13:22.769
Whatever. It's your camera.

266
00:13:30.978 --> 00:13:32.879
Please. you've got
to let me back in.

267
00:13:32.947 --> 00:13:35.348
I sold 6.000 rolls of
wrapping paper to get here.

268
00:13:35.416 --> 00:13:36.383
That's your problem.

269
00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:37.951
You. my friend. are banned

270
00:13:38.019 --> 00:13:39.653
from ever entering
this church again.

271
00:13:40.588 --> 00:13:42.756
Banned for life?

272
00:13:42.823 --> 00:13:45.292
Homer. do you know
why I'm a Christian?

273
00:13:45.359 --> 00:13:46.760
Your parents made you?

274
00:13:46.827 --> 00:13:51.331
It's because I believe every soul
has the possibility of salvation.

275
00:13:51.399 --> 00:13:53.867
At least I thought so till now.

276
00:13:53.935 --> 00:13:57.837
Homer Simpson.
you are not worth saving.

277
00:13:57.905 --> 00:14:01.341
What? But I thought we'd be
neighbors in Heaven.

278
00:14:01.409 --> 00:14:03.476
- Goofing on all the new dead people.
- Not...

279
00:14:03.544 --> 00:14:05.912
Worth... Saving!

280
00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.981
Ned! Ned. wait up!

281
00:14:14.689 --> 00:14:16.756
Ned's run off into the desert!

282
00:14:18.092 --> 00:14:21.294
A sand horse. car of the desert!

283
00:14:37.511 --> 00:14:42.582
Nothing like a tall glass of lukewarm
water to Jekyll down this Hyde.

284
00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.618
Ooh. looks like a
sandstorm's brewing.

285
00:14:44.685 --> 00:14:46.920
I'll just wait it out at a movie.

286
00:14:50.591 --> 00:14:51.558
Orthobot Prime.

287
00:14:51.626 --> 00:14:54.127
the battle begins!

288
00:14:54.195 --> 00:14:57.297
Not so fast. we can't
transform on the Sabbath!

289
00:14:57.365 --> 00:15:01.134
Let us power down and
contemplate the Torah.

290
00:15:12.313 --> 00:15:14.147
Flanders!

291
00:15:14.215 --> 00:15:16.583
Stupid Flanders!

292
00:15:21.789 --> 00:15:25.225
There's sand in my shoe too!

293
00:15:31.599 --> 00:15:34.968
Good luck surviving without me!

294
00:15:35.036 --> 00:15:37.404
<i>Thirsty</i>

295
00:15:37.471 --> 00:15:40.507
<i>I am so thirsty</i>

296
00:15:40.574 --> 00:15:44.644
<i>And hungry and horny</i>

297
00:15:44.712 --> 00:15:48.982
<i>But mostly just thirsty</i>

298
00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.252
<i>I am so thirsty</i>

299
00:15:54.088 --> 00:15:55.488
Water!

300
00:15:58.125 --> 00:15:59.959
So salty!

301
00:16:00.027 --> 00:16:03.663
Maybe if I add a little salt.

302
00:16:31.726 --> 00:16:33.727
You have been chosen. Homer.

303
00:16:33.794 --> 00:16:36.296
Chosen for what. o Mighty Gherkin?

304
00:16:36.363 --> 00:16:39.199
Rise and listen. my child.

305
00:16:39.266 --> 00:16:42.635
Yours is a great destiny.

306
00:16:42.703 --> 00:16:47.540
Pickle. carrot. tomato...
Pickle. carrot. tomato...

307
00:16:49.777 --> 00:16:52.679
Oh. Homie. you're alive!

308
00:16:52.747 --> 00:16:55.648
I am more than alive. woman.

309
00:16:55.716 --> 00:16:57.751
I am the chosen one

310
00:16:57.818 --> 00:17:00.820
who shall unite all
the faiths of the Holy Land!

311
00:17:00.888 --> 00:17:04.023
I am the Messiah!

312
00:17:04.091 --> 00:17:06.226
But you still have
our passports. right?

313
00:17:06.293 --> 00:17:07.727
Oh. yeah.

314
00:17:07.795 --> 00:17:09.996
Got to keep track of those.

315
00:17:10.064 --> 00:17:11.998
The Messiah...

316
00:17:12.066 --> 00:17:13.833
has the passports.

317
00:17:18.104 --> 00:17:21.606
- Dad. are you okay?
- I am more than okay!

318
00:17:21.674 --> 00:17:24.442
I am the Messiah.
come to save the world!

319
00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:26.277
Look upon me and shudder!

320
00:17:26.345 --> 00:17:27.479
I already do that.

321
00:17:27.546 --> 00:17:29.481
Messiah?

322
00:17:29.548 --> 00:17:32.517
- Do you mind if I have a word with your wife?
- As you wish.

323
00:17:32.585 --> 00:17:34.452
But look not upon her with lust.

324
00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.387
and do not send her
friendly e-mails.

325
00:17:36.455 --> 00:17:38.022
That's how it begins.

326
00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.527
Homer is suffering from
what's called

327
00:17:42.595 --> 00:17:44.129
Jerusalem syndrome.

328
00:17:44.196 --> 00:17:46.364
Ah. yes. Jerusalem syndrome.

329
00:17:46.432 --> 00:17:48.666
The name given to religious
delusions or psychoses

330
00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:50.769
that occur when people
visit Jerusalem.

331
00:17:50.836 --> 00:17:53.872
Have you ever noticed that
Dad always gets the disease

332
00:17:53.939 --> 00:17:55.974
they write about in the
in-flight magazine?

333
00:17:56.041 --> 00:17:57.308
Oh. my God!

334
00:17:57.376 --> 00:17:58.643
Homer's gone!

335
00:18:00.946 --> 00:18:02.814
What's he gonna do now?

336
00:18:02.882 --> 00:18:06.584
Dad said he was going
to unite all faiths.

337
00:18:06.652 --> 00:18:10.522
And only one site is sacred to
Muslims. Christians and Jews.

338
00:18:10.589 --> 00:18:11.689
The Dome of the Rock!

339
00:18:11.757 --> 00:18:13.024
Dome of the Rock?

340
00:18:13.092 --> 00:18:14.359
Messiah away...!

341
00:18:16.962 --> 00:18:20.198
This one says Carolina Panthers!

342
00:18:20.266 --> 00:18:22.801
Messiah says rowrr!

343
00:18:22.868 --> 00:18:26.171
Okay. everybody. come on.

344
00:18:26.238 --> 00:18:27.939
This shrine contains the rock

345
00:18:28.007 --> 00:18:30.708
on which Abraham was going
to sacrifice his son.

346
00:18:30.776 --> 00:18:33.278
And Muslims believe something too.

347
00:18:33.345 --> 00:18:35.346
To find out.
hire a Muslim tour guide.

348
00:18:35.414 --> 00:18:36.681
That's a barrel of laughs.

349
00:18:36.749 --> 00:18:38.449
- Anyway. shut your face.
- Thanks.

350
00:18:38.517 --> 00:18:40.518
You can stop giving the tour now.

351
00:18:40.586 --> 00:18:43.421
You don't want to do a photo with me?
You can hold my gun.

352
00:18:43.489 --> 00:18:46.591
- I used it in Entebbe. I killed three Ugandans.
- No. thanks.

353
00:18:46.659 --> 00:18:49.794
Before you go in.
you fill out comment card.

354
00:18:49.862 --> 00:18:50.962
Okay.

355
00:18:53.599 --> 00:18:55.400
Don't forget the back.

356
00:18:55.467 --> 00:18:57.202
You people are so pushy.

357
00:18:57.269 --> 00:18:59.204
What. Israeli people are pushy?

358
00:18:59.271 --> 00:19:01.606
How about you experience
a couple of genocides

359
00:19:01.674 --> 00:19:03.308
and see how laid-back you are?

360
00:19:03.375 --> 00:19:05.844
We were purged from Spain!
Throw out of there!

361
00:19:05.911 --> 00:19:07.846
They allow everybody in Spain!

362
00:19:07.913 --> 00:19:10.615
But for us. Jews.
no flamenco. get out!

363
00:19:10.683 --> 00:19:12.417
I'm pushy? Please.

364
00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:16.487
You stay there. surrounded by
your great enemy. Canada!

365
00:19:16.555 --> 00:19:19.958
Try Syria for two months.
then we'll see who's pushy!

366
00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:25.530
Attention. Christians.
Muslims. and Jews.

367
00:19:25.598 --> 00:19:27.999
I have come to gather
you into a new faith.

368
00:19:28.067 --> 00:19:30.235
From now on.
you shall be called...

369
00:19:30.302 --> 00:19:32.270
Chrismujews.

370
00:19:32.338 --> 00:19:34.172
I don't know.

371
00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:38.243
Because when you get down to it.
aren't all religions the same?

372
00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:40.144
They tell you what to eat.

373
00:19:40.212 --> 00:19:41.512
when to pray.

374
00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.815
how this imperfect
clay that we call man

375
00:19:43.883 --> 00:19:46.851
can mold itself to
resemble the divine.

376
00:19:46.919 --> 00:19:49.087
But we can never attain
that ultimate grace

377
00:19:49.154 --> 00:19:51.789
while there is hatred in
our hearts for each other.

378
00:19:51.857 --> 00:19:52.991
I did it.

379
00:19:53.058 --> 00:19:54.259
I reached him.

380
00:19:54.326 --> 00:19:56.094
Celebrate your commonality.

381
00:19:56.161 --> 00:19:57.929
Some of us don't eat pork.

382
00:19:57.997 --> 00:20:00.298
Some of us don't eat shellfish.

383
00:20:00.366 --> 00:20:03.167
But all of us love chicken.

384
00:20:03.235 --> 00:20:04.602
He's right!

385
00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.337
You can simmer it in a tagine.

386
00:20:06.405 --> 00:20:08.106
In a soup. you can boil it!

387
00:20:08.173 --> 00:20:09.374
Spread the word!

388
00:20:09.441 --> 00:20:11.843
Peace and chicken.

389
00:20:11.911 --> 00:20:14.145
Peace and chicken!

390
00:20:14.213 --> 00:20:16.281
Don't listen to this fat idiot!

391
00:20:16.348 --> 00:20:17.849
I am your Messiah!

392
00:20:17.917 --> 00:20:20.718
Avert your eyes from
my wrinkly arms!

393
00:20:20.786 --> 00:20:23.554
Got another case
of Jerusalem syndrome.

394
00:20:23.622 --> 00:20:25.957
This looks like a job for...

395
00:20:26.025 --> 00:20:27.458
The Messiah!

396
00:20:32.698 --> 00:20:34.165
I want the window seat!

397
00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:35.833
Krav Maga!

398
00:20:35.901 --> 00:20:37.502
You can't hurt what's already dead.

399
00:20:37.569 --> 00:20:39.070
I guess you can.

400
00:20:39.138 --> 00:20:41.372
Homer. my friend.
of all the false messiahs today.

401
00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:43.441
I think you came
closest to the truth.

402
00:20:43.509 --> 00:20:45.510
Well. if I made any sense today.

403
00:20:45.577 --> 00:20:48.479
it's because all the stuff
you've told me all these years

404
00:20:48.547 --> 00:20:50.381
has finally seeped in.

405
00:20:50.449 --> 00:20:52.850
Can I buy you a $12
turkey sandwich?

406
00:20:52.918 --> 00:20:54.319
I'd like that.

407
00:20:54.386 --> 00:20:57.220
How about a Greg Norman executive
putter from the skymall?

408
00:20:57.288 --> 00:20:59.991
You'd probably get a better deal
at a mall back home.

409
00:21:00.059 --> 00:21:01.659
They have malls on land?

410
00:21:06.699 --> 00:21:08.399
Why don't you try having
your people

411
00:21:08.467 --> 00:21:10.101
being thrown out of Spain?!

412
00:21:10.169 --> 00:21:13.204
Spain! No tapas!
I love eating tapas!

413
00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:14.806
I love the tiny portions!

414
00:21:14.873 --> 00:21:16.541
You don't get too full.

415
00:21:16.608 --> 00:21:19.177
but you have a whole
variety of flavors!

416
00:21:19.244 --> 00:21:21.846
Not for me! Every day
hummus and pita!

417
00:21:21.914 --> 00:21:25.650
Occasionally. once a week.
a little bit of falafel!
